---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="女人我最大賞 2026 · 首頁">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-frame p-8">
    <p class="text-xs tracking-[2px] text-ink-tertiary">SCAFFOLD OK</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl">Astro + Tailwind 地基已就緒</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-readable text-base text-ink-secondary">
      這是骨架驗證頁。字級走 token：text-3xl(48) / text-base(16) / text-xs(12)；色彩用
      ink / gold token。確認跑得起來後，下一步從首頁開始把區塊拆成元件。
    </p>
    <a
      href="#"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:bg-gold-deep"
      data-track="cta_demo"
    >
      看完整盤點<i class="ti ti-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
